"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThis is a work that makes you think deeply.  \nI was able to have many discussions and stories through this work in a book club.  \n\nThe Unhappy Boy only realizes the angel's gaslighting at the last moment.  \nThe angel's whisper might be the gaslighting that this society is doing to us in the name of order.  \n\nArmor City seems to show a very realistic and hollow reality that cannot be solved.  \n\nI highly recommend this work because each story allows for deep thinking and discussion.  "